<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/26/eng@/~part_III__cl_8__subsec_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/26/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/26/eng@/~part_III__cl_8__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "An employee who has been prematurely retired by his employer has, within sixty days from the date of the retirement, the option to complain in writing to the Director General."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/26/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/26/eng@/~part_III__cl_8__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/26/eng@/~part_III__cl_8> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/26/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/26/eng@/~part_III__cl_8__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "2" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/26/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/26/eng@/~part_III__cl_8__subsec_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/26/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/26/eng@/~part_III__cl_8__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "If an employee opts to make a complaint to the Director General under subsection (1), the employee shall not make a representation under section 20 of the Industrial Relations Act 1967 until his complaint to the Director General under this section has been resolved."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/26/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/26/eng@/~part_III__cl_8__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/26/eng@/~part_III__cl_8> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/26/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/26/eng@/~part_III__cl_8__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "3" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/26/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/26/eng@/~part_III__cl_8__subsec_3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/26/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/26/eng@/~part_III__cl_8__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "If an employee has made a representation under section 20 of the Industrial Relations Act 1967 and also made a complaint under subsection (1), the Director General shall not conduct an inquiry on the complaint made by the employee."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/26/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/26/eng@/~part_III__cl_8__subsec_4> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/26/eng@/~part_III__cl_8> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/26/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/26/eng@/~part_III__cl_8__subsec_4> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "4" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/26/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/26/eng@/~part_III__cl_8__subsec_4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/26/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/26/eng@/~part_III__cl_8__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "Subject to subsection (3), the Director General may conduct an inquiry, in the manner prescribed by the Minister, to determine whether there is prima facie evidence that an employee has been prematurely retired by his employer."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/26/eng@> .
