<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/26/eng@/~part_II__cl_4__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "The Minister may, by notification in the Gazette, prescribe a minimum retirement age higher than the minimum retirement age provided under subsection (1)."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/26/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/26/eng@/~part_II__cl_4__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/26/eng@/~part_II__cl_4> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/26/eng@> .
