<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/26/eng@/~part_II__cl_5__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "An employer shall not prematurely retire an employee before the employee attains the minimum retirement age."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/26/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/26/eng@/~part_II__cl_5__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/26/eng@/~part_II__cl_5> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/26/eng@> .
