<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/26/eng@/~part_II__cl_5__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "An employer who contravenes subsection (1) commits an offence and shall, on conviction, be liable to a fine not exceeding ten thousand ringgit."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/26/eng@> .
