<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/26/eng@/~part_V__cl_17__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "The Director General may, with the consent in writing of the Public Prosecutor, compound any offence committed by any employer under this Act which is prescribed to be a compoundable offence by making a written offer to the employer suspected to have committed the offence to compound the offence upon payment to the Director General of an amount of money not exceeding fifty per centum of the amount of maximum fine for that offence within the time specified in the offer."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/26/eng@> .
