<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/26/eng@/~part_V__cl_17__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "If an offence has been compounded under subsection (1), no prosecution shall be instituted in respect of the offence against the employer to whom the offer to compound was made. Exemption"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/26/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/26/eng@/~part_V__cl_18> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/26/eng@/~part_V> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/26/eng@> .
