<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/26/eng@/~part_V__cl_18> <https://schema.org/text> "The Minister may, by order published in the Gazette, exempt with or without conditions any employer or class of employers from all or any of the provisions of this Act. Power to make regulations"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/26/eng@> .
